ght number: `19.99 * 100` is `1998.999\u2026`, which became `1998`. That's why three tests were off by a cent or more:\n- 19.99 became 1998 instead of 1999.\n- 0.29 \u00d7 3 became 84 instead of 87.\n- 4.35 \u00d7 2 with a 10% discount came out 781 instead of 783.\n\n**Fix:** `to_cents` now turns the amount into a `Decimal` via `str(amount)`, multiplies by 100, and rounds half up. That matches the rounding already used in `discounts.py` and `tax.py`. `Line.cents()` is the only place that calls `to_cents`, so nothing else needed changing.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 6, "replies_ok": 7, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 95532, "requests_cache_write": 127064, "requests_cost_usd": 0.6899504000000001, "requests_count": 7, "requests_input_uncached": 16, "requests_output": 1773, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-multistep:claude-opus-5-5:trial27", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 233, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-20T02:38:41.001982+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 26.692, "t_checker_s": 0.326, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-multistep", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "default", "thinking_sent": ["adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1789, "tokens_cache_read": 95532, "tokens_cache_write": 127064, "tokens_fresh": 1789, "tokens_input_uncached": 16, "tokens_main_cache_read": 95532, "tokens_main_cache_write": 127064, "tokens_main_calls": 7, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 16, "tokens_main_output": 1773, "tokens_output": 1773, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 95532, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 127064, "tokens_proxy_calls"